      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hello, I’m a Korean player currently residing in Korea, and I’ve been greatly enjoying watching the development of Project Aincrad while playing it.\n\nI reached out through the official Argus Discord server, where both the developers and players of the VRChat world Project Aincrad are active, to express my interest in contributing to or possibly taking part in the Korean localization of the project.\n\nI was kindly directed here, but since I don't have prior experience with localization, I’m not quite sure where to start.\n\nIf it’s not too much trouble, I’d like to kindly ask for some guidance on how and where I should begin. Thank you very much for your time and help.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
