  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-06-17T07:24:50.344Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "VRC supports various languages itself, however world are only limited to one language for  the world details. \n\nVRC should provide a way for world creators to have different world name/description depending to the user language settings which would provide a better accessibility and tell the player that the world support their language",
